cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AMReX
abstract: >-
  A software framework for massively parallel block-structured adaptive mesh
  refinement applications.
message: >-
  If you use AMReX, we ask you to cite the JOSS paper (the preferred citation
  below) and the first IJHPCA paper.  If you have also used pyAMReX and/or you
  use more modern features of AMReX, please also cite the second IJHPCA paper.
  You should also cite the Zenodo DOI for the code release you used; a BibTeX
  entry for the latest release can be found at
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2555438.
